normalized.text:
{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA-n2000 encoder, without image data or fusion, as a baseline to compare against a prior multimodal approach. Validation accuracy of 0.4849 (F1: 0.4639) is lower than the prior multimodal configuration's 0.5266 (F1: 0.5104), suggesting potential value in multimodal integration. However, the absence of direct comparisons to other single-modality baselines leaves uncertainty about whether the observed difference stems from modality combination or other uncontrolled factors."
}

